      "msgid": "petDescription/dog_1",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "The German Shepherd moved silently across the battlefield, senses keen. When a blast floored its handler, the dog dragged the fallen man to cover and shielded him until rescue came. Wounded but loyal, never leaving his side. A true soldier's guardian.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "petDescription/dog_2",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Always eager for adventure, this lively Labrador is a loyal companion who barks approvingly at the sound of human laughter and wags his tail when making new friends. Rumor has it he's been seen in two places at once, though nobody has yet worked out how.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
